<title>USA: McRae Industries Q1 Nov 2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>McRae Industries Q1 Nov 2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT GILEAD, N.C. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.32		    $0.13</p>
<p> Net		 890			344</p>
<p> Revs		17,141		   10,412</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  2,742		    2,732</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is McRae Industries Inc.</p>
<p>The company said second and third quarter revenues and earnings would be hurt by a scheduled reduction in combat boot shipments. The company said first quarter revenues and earnings increased due to early delivery of military combat boots for U.S. government. The contract is set to be completed in the third quarter with a substantial reduction in pairs scheduled to be shipped during the second and third quarters.</p>
</text>
